# Security headers for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# These have to be HTTP headers, not <meta>. `frame-ancestors` in particular is
# ignored inside a meta CSP and the browser logs an error for it — so putting it
# there looks like protection while providing none. Base.astro carries the rest of
# the CSP as meta because the fetch directives DO work there; this file carries
# what does not.
#
# Verify after the first deploy, do not assume:
#   curl -sI https://<host>/ | grep -iE 'frame-options|frame-ancestors|referrer'

# HSTS: two years, the preload-list minimum. No `preload` token — submitting to the
# preload list is a one-way door for every subdomain, and is a decision for when the
# real domain is attached (plans/lotus-web/issues/09), not for pages.dev.
#
# Cache-Control on /*: HTML and every unhashed file always revalidate, so a deploy
# shows at once. /_astro/* overrides it below.
#
# Comments stay at column 0: Pages reads an indented line inside a block as a header.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

# Vite fingerprints everything under /_astro/ (CSS, JS, fonts, images): a changed file
# gets a new name, so the old name can be cached forever. Pages JOINS a header that two
# rules both set ("a, b"), so `! Cache-Control` first detaches the /* value.
/_astro/*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Pages would guess from the extension; the manifest spec names this type.
/site.webmanifest
  ! Content-Type
  Content-Type: application/manifest+json; charset=utf-8

# Preview deploys (<hash>.lotus-web.pages.dev, branch aliases) must not compete with the
# real site in search results. `:version` is a Pages placeholder; it matches one label.
https://:version.lotus-web.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
